{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeRancher-9284": "RANCHER: 想回镇上去？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeRancher-9285": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeRancher-9286": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9287": "LEONA: 哟，大人总算有空，来处理这堆积如山的信件了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9288": "LEONA: 亲爱的，我可不会永远当你的秘书，尤其还有这么一大堆事要管。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9289": "ALEXANDRA: 信件？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9290": "LEONA: 对。这些是议会发来的正式问询。那些飞空艇究竟是怎么造出来的，到现在还没查清。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9291": "LEONA: 这一叠是学者寄来的，请她帮忙解读最近重新发现的外语。有意思的是，这类信她回得最快。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9292": "CORDELIA: 可惜我们试过了，把古埃特伦语和古希纳尔语的铭文念出声来，齐卡隆还是翻译不了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9293": "CORDELIA: 看来，他得能感知说话的人心里在想什么才行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9294": "LEONA: 剩下的嘛，可以说都来自“倾慕者”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9295": "LEONA: 上回数的时候，里面至少有三封求婚信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9296": "CORDELIA: 是吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9297": "JEROME: 有没有什么紧急的事，需要我们现在处理？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9298": "LEONA: 嗯……倒是有一件，一位女工匠写来的信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9299": "LEONA: 起初我还以为，她每天都寄一封一模一样的来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9300": "LEONA: 可后来，纸上我的指印越来越多，我才明白：她给这封信施了法，让它总能回到信堆最上面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9301": "LEONA: 你认识费奥兰的奥克塔维娅·科诺弗小姐吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9302": "CORDELIA: 她是个极有前途的年轻人，可惜眼下的环境远不足以让她施展才华。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9303": "CORDELIA: 我看看……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9304": "CORDELIA: 她说有了新发现，一件防御装备，或许“能帮你们应付老家那摊子事”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-cordeliaQuestBegin-9305": "CORDELIA: 以她以往的发明本事，我们该去趟费奥兰，坐飞空艇很快就能到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-leonaEleven-9306": "LEONA: 但愿你动作快些，你母亲迟早会想搬回来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-leonaEleven-9307": "LEONA: 轰炸刚过那会儿，科黛莉娅拉着我的手都不肯松。现在倒好，比幽灵还难见着！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-leonaEleven-9308": "LEONA: 啊，你就是那位亚马逊女战士，科黛莉娅说的你们国家监管魔法的方式，是真的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-leonaEleven-9309": "LEONA: 你一定就是大名鼎鼎的亚历珊德拉，要知道，科黛莉娅最爱搜罗聪明姑娘了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-leonaEleven-9310": "LEONA: 你就是本？看起来也没那么糟嘛。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-leonaEleven-9311": "LEONA: 轰炸刚过那会儿，科黛莉娅拉着我的手都不肯松。现在倒好，比幽灵还难见着！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-leonaEleven-9312": "LEONA: 你就是那头有智慧的食草动物？真高兴见到你！简直像从故事书里走出来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-leonaEleven-9313": "LEONA: 哎呀，雷诺医生！既然科黛莉娅的日程归我管，你要是想让我腾点时间，安排……什么特别的事，尽管说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9314": "CORDELIA: 这里到底发生了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9315": "CORDELIA: 奥克塔维娅？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9316": "CORDELIA: 科诺弗先生？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9317": "MAN: 你们从首都来的？还以为消息没传那么快呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9318": "CORDELIA: 什么消息？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9319": "MAN: 科诺弗一家出事的消息。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9320": "MAN: 等等，你不就是去年那位女警长？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9321": "CORDELIA: 科诺弗一家，他们怎么了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9322": "MAN: 几天前来了个男人，凶得很，不肯按新法交枪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9323": "MAN: 他进镇没几分钟，不知打听到了什么，就怒气冲冲地闯进了这栋楼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9324": "MAN: 又过了几分钟，科诺弗父女就被他捆着拖出来了，你也知道，那父女俩可都不是好对付的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9325": "CORDELIA: 大家就袖手旁观，任由他这么做？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9326": "MAN: 哪能啊，我们几个赶过去，可他一挥手就把我们冻在原地，我的靴子第二天才化开。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9327": "JEROME: 那人既是法师，又是枪手？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9328": "ALEXANDRA: 他好像留了字条。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9329": "CORDELIA: “致臭名昭著的赫尔蒙特小姐。”",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9330": "CORDELIA: “你们暗算了我兄弟，我也打算礼尚往来。”",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9331": "CORDELIA: “想保住这两个赏金猎人的命，就独自来鹰岭尽头，正午时分。不容商量。”",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9332": "CORDELIA: 署名，“杜林·库姆斯”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9333": "CORDELIA: 鹰岭在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9334": "MAN: 我能带路，不过这家伙可不像守信的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9335": "MAN: 他要真像自己说的，是老库姆斯的兄弟，那他的话就更信不得了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9336": "CORDELIA: 我无意束手就擒，我们能收拾他兄弟，也完全有本事收拾这位“杜林”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9337": "CORDELIA: 不过，得谨慎行事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverInvestigation-9338": "MAN: 要人领你们去山岭，就到镇边找我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeChoice-9339": "MAN: 还打算去鹰岭吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeChoice-9340": "还没准备好",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeChoice-9341": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9342": "MAN: 得先说一声，去年那几起抢劫案之前，这兄弟俩里，杜林·库姆斯才是名声更响的那个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9343": "MAN: 他会魔法倒是出乎我意料，不过作为神枪手，他早就恶名远扬了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9344": "MAN: 多半还没等你们靠近，他就会开枪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9345": "JEROME: 更别说他还要求你独自前往。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9346": "CORDELIA: 自然要用计接近。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9347": "CORDELIA: 听说你很擅长幻术伪装，能把我们变成同一副模样吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9348": "NIKOLAI: 哦，现在倒肯听人点菜了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9349": "BEN: 这帮人长得不错。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9350": "AGATA: 不可思议，我的手和衣服闻起来都是百里香和洋葱味。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9351": "CORDELIA: 很出色，不过得全变成我的样子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9352": "BEN: 这就没意思了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9353": "BEN: 话说，这样有什么用？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9354": "CORDELIA: 我能增强幻术，让这许多个身影看起来像是蜃景。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9355": "CORDELIA: 可惜，我和齐卡隆的幻形术，都遮不住我们之中……身形较宽大的几位。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9356": "BEN: 嘿，你要是偶尔肯好好吃点东西，没准就不会这么大脾气。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9357": "NIKOLAI: 大概是身上带的东西太多，可要去打仗，也不能丢下装备。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9358": "CORDELIA: 确实不能。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9359": "CORDELIA: 多数幻形术都能遮住铠甲，否则历来也派不上多少用场。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9360": "CORDELIA: 或许只需卸下随身物品？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9361": "JEROME: 帮忙拿一下这些，好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9362": "JEROME: 再试试看……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9363": "NIKOLAI: 应该够像了……至少从瞄准镜里看是这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTravel-9364": "MAN: 我替你们保管东西，等你们回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-sniperComment-9365": "NIKOLAI: 他们说他是狙击手。看来他给我们摆了道难关。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-sniperComment-9366": "NIKOLAI: 这些大岩石能当掩护。在岩石之间移动时，跑得越快越好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-hawkRidgeTrapdoor-9367": "CORDELIA: 唔……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-octaviaCave-9368": "CORDELIA: ……奥克塔维娅？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-octaviaCave-9369": "OCTAVIA: 哟，这场面可真有意思。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-octaviaCave-9370": "OCTAVIA: 现在可以把那玩意撤了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-octaviaCave-9371": "CORDELIA: 可既然你在这里……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-octaviaCave-9372": "OCTAVIA: 我也用了那种幻形术，看着挺实用，就学了学。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-octaviaCave-9373": "OCTAVIA: 我造了个自己的幻影，趁那亡命徒不留神，偷偷溜了出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-octaviaCave-9374": "OCTAVIA: 可我家老头子还被他捆着，跟套牛比赛里的小牛似的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-octaviaCave-9375": "CORDELIA: 既然你能溜出来，我们也许能打这位“杜林”一个措手不及。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-octaviaCave-9376": "OCTAVIA: 那就来吧，打起精神，脚下轻点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinOne-9377": "DEWLIN: 你躲不了一辈子……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinOne-9378": "DEWLIN: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinOne-9379": "DEWLIN: 什么鬼？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinOne-9380": "DEWLIN: 不许再动，我杀人，用不着这么多理由。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinOne-9381": "DEWLIN: 这点我得认，亲爱的，能把这一伙都带上来，你确实像传闻里那么狡猾。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinOne-9382": "CORDELIA: 你已无路可走，唯有投降。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinOne-9383": "DEWLIN: 那是你以为。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinOne-9384": "DEWLIN: 指定正午可不只是为了摆派头，我还赶着搭车呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinOne-9385": "OCTAVIA: 这吃蛇的混账。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-tracksOctavia-9386": "OCTAVIA: 他朝你开枪了？到底对你干了什么！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-tracksConover-9387": "CONOVER: 别管我！逮住那混蛋！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinTwo-9388": "DEWLIN: 你还真是不肯罢休啊？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinTwo-9389": "CORDELIA: 我不会罢休。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinTwo-9390": "DEWLIN: 嘿，我就佩服你这点。心里像有台发动机，怎么都停不下来。这滋味我懂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinTwo-9391": "CORDELIA: 是吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinTwo-9392": "DEWLIN: 当然，要是我生下来是个体面的富家少爷，你是码头酒鬼的孩子……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinTwo-9393": "DEWLIN: 那咱俩的位置就会掉个个儿，因为谁都没法让心里那台机器停下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinTwo-9394": "DEWLIN: 法律在乎的只有你是谁，不在乎你做了什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinTwo-9395": "CORDELIA: 既然你这样想，就别再装作了解我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-dewlinTwo-9396": "DEWLIN: 好啊，亲爱的，那就见个分晓。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9397": "CONOVER: 哎哟！别弄了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9398": "OCTAVIA: 能不能别乱动？我在给你整理绷带。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9399": "CONOVER: 都说我没事了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9400": "JEROME: 让我看看？捆绑太久，手脚可能会出现坏疽。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9401": "OCTAVIA: 请吧，这倔老头我快受够了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9402": "OCTAVIA: 你们肯定收到我的信了吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9403": "CORDELIA: 收到了，也见识了信上那道巧妙的附魔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9404": "OCTAVIA: 那可是我的得意之作。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9405": "OCTAVIA: 不过，这个更让我得意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9406": "CORDELIA: 信？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9407": "OCTAVIA: 算了，不提那个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9408": "OCTAVIA: 我想让你们看的，是这个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9409": "获得秘银面罩！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9410": "CORDELIA: 这是某种……锁甲？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9411": "OCTAVIA: 是啊，小姐，重点是材料，这金属来自尘风峡谷上头的矿井。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9412": "OCTAVIA: 几个月前，矿业公司停了那边的活，因为矿工们都说撞见了各种鬼影怪事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9413": "OCTAVIA: 铁矿石当然早被他们运走了，可这种金属的矿脉还留着——到底是什么金属，我也说不准。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9414": "OCTAVIA: 就是加工起来特别费事，可一旦弄成了，那可比钢结实多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9415": "CORDELIA: 这种矿物真出自附近的矿井？而且没人感兴趣？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9416": "OCTAVIA: 这个嘛……矿工们说那下面有东西作祟，可真不是瞎编的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9417": "OCTAVIA: 我要是再文雅点，可能会说那是种“面对浩瀚宇宙时的恐惧”，可我没那么有诗意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9418": "OCTAVIA: 反正，我尽量只在入口附近活动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9419": "CORDELIA: 你的作品，一如既往地无人能及。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9420": "CORDELIA: 哪天想去首都工作只管告诉我，工坊也好，铸造厂也好，任你挑选。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9421": "OCTAVIA: 别误会，可看你们一个个脸白的，我多半喜欢不来那边的天气。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-conoverEpilogue-9422": "CORDELIA: 要知道，我们每月至少也有一天晴天，至少夏天是这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-artemisStaff-9423": "获得阿里马泰乌斯之杖！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-superBoss-9424": "<align=\"center\">谨记此诫：阿里马泰乌斯之杖曾将巨兽封印于此墓中。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-superBoss-9425": "要挑战巨兽之力吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-superBoss-9426": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-superBoss-9427": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-superBoss-9428": "<align=\"center\">……那便如此……</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-octaviaBeatBobby-9429": "OCTAVIA: 等等，你们一走过，我店里的矿石全叮当响了起来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-octaviaBeatBobby-9430": "OCTAVIA: 你们去对付矿井里那个作祟的东西了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/cordeliaSidequest.yarn-octaviaBeatBobby-9431": "OCTAVIA: 算了，别告诉我，照文雅人的说法，这些都不在我的职责范围。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3476": "Title: 来往书信",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3477": "Description: 返回科黛莉娅在莱奥尼亚的家，查看她的信件。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3478": "Title: 再度出马",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3479": "Description: 科黛莉娅收到了费奥兰的来信，前往那里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3480": "Title: 故人有难",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3481": "Description: 在费奥兰镇边与向导会合。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3482": "Title: 枪口之下",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3483": "Description: 穿过杜林布下的险地！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3484": "Title: 正午对决",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3485": "Description: 追上杜林，与他对决！"
}
